     "title": {
      "romaji": "Boushoku no Berserk: Ore Dake Level to Iu Gainen wo Toppa Suru THE COMIC",
      "english": "Berserk of Gluttony",
      "native": "暴食のベルセルク～俺だけレベルという概念を突破する～ THE COMIC"
     },
     "synonyms": [
      "Berserk of Gluttony: The One That Exceeds The Concept Of Levels",
      "Boushoku no Berserk",
      "จอมตะกละดาบคลั่ง -ข้านี่แหละจะทะลวงแนวความคิดที่เรียกว่าเลเวลเอง- The comic"
     ],
     "description": "Fate Graphite has never tasted true power. Born into a world with two kinds of people—those with superior skills and those without—he’s been shunned his entire life. Fate’s skill is Gluttony, a curse that leaves him constantly hungry… until he awakens its terrible potential. When he kills someone, he can devour their skills and feed his insatiable appetite. How many lives will it take for Fate’s Gluttony to finally be satisfied?\n<br><br>\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)",
